# Exemptions for the real React gate (scripts/verify-react.sh).
#
# Format: TAB-separated — path<TAB>code<TAB>reason<TAB>count-cap<TAB>deferral
#   path      = concrete generated file (relative to react-test-app/) — the
#               gate is per-file, NOT category-wide: an error in a file with
#               no exemption is a regression even if the same code is exempt
#               elsewhere (HIGH-1)
#   code      = TSxxxx (tsc) or bare eslint rule id
#   reason    = root-cause task (T1.3/T1.6/T3.2/T3.3) + why this error is exempt
#   count-cap = instance cap: the gate FAILS when a (path, code) pair exceeds
#               its cap (new instances of a known class = regression). Every
#               cap equals the actual instance count at the T0.4 snapshot;
#               raising a cap requires a documented reason
#   deferral  = deferral # in deferrals.md for the root-cause work (all
#               entries assigned by task 0.6; '-' = untracked — fails
#               scripts/check_exemption_ledger.sh)
#
# Gate semantics:
#   - a non-exempt error fails the gate (new regression)
#   - an UNUSED exemption fails the gate (stale entry — delete it when the
#     root cause lands; do not leave it to rot)
#   - exceeding a count-cap fails the gate (error class ballooning)
#
# Counts: 166 tsc errors + 121 eslint problems over 157 generated files at
# the T0.4 snapshot (2026-08-03, fresh `omnic build --target react` output,
# react 19.2.8 + zustand 5.0.14). Per-code totals: TS7006 45, TS2339 24,
# TS2322 14, TS2353 14, TS2345 14, TS2304 10, TS2722 23, TS2588 7, TS2554 6,
# TS18048 4, TS7005 2, TS7034 1, TS2367 2; exhaustive-deps 91, no-unused-vars
# 17, no-var 10, no-control-regex 2, no-explicit-any 1.
# Current snapshot (task 2.6, 2026-08-04): tsc 140 errors + 32 eslint
# problems (all exempted). exhaustive-deps 91 → 2: the 8 @unmount/_M
# entries below are REMOVED (task 2.6 — cleanup reads enter deps; _M hoisted
# to module scope); remaining 2 are FilterBar (new-array demoFrameworks
# useMemo dep) + UserSettings (saveSettings fn dep), pre-existing classes.
#
# tsc — C1 class (function/typed-state emission) → Task 1.6
